  <component name="VcsManagerConfiguration">
    <MESSAGE value="Install mysql2 into release stage via npm instead of a hand-copied dep list.&#10;Hand-copied packages missed sql-escaper and broke CI packaging." />
    <MESSAGE value="Fix PreProd gallery background: ensure DB column and ship current catalog mapping.&#10;Self-heal background_image_url, pin PM2 cwd for assets, unify publicMediaUrl for admin/public." />
    <MESSAGE value="Include SQL migrations in release tarball so VPS apply can ensure schema.&#10;&#10;Previously only *.sh/*.mjs were packed, so migrate-*.sql never reached PreProd." />
    <MESSAGE value="background_image_url issue" />
    <MESSAGE value="prod background_image_url issue" />
    <MESSAGE value="poweredByPrefix added to admin to edit" />
    <MESSAGE value="#1 The mega menu was offset with translateY(0.8rem) on hover, so the pointer left the menu item in that gap and the submenu closed" />
    <MESSAGE value="#3 Two catalog UI fixes:&#10;   1. Popup catalog-gallery-media — Removed the inset frame box-shadow. Also hardened gallery background so background-image isn’t wiped by the background shorthand (inline size/position included).&#10;   2. catalog-card image — Cards used next/image with fill on a position: absolute media layer; this Next version only paints fill when the parent is relative or display: block. Switched to a plain &lt;img&gt; with cover sizing (same pattern as hub cards), so thumbnails show correctly again." />
    <MESSAGE value="#4 Product, Services, Project Pages Hero and Catalog filter controls from admin" />
    <MESSAGE value="#4 show/hide switch in admin for catalog-hero-standard-panel" />
    <MESSAGE value="#4 show/hide switch in admin for catalog-hero-meta" />
    <MESSAGE value="#4 Hero elements (show/hide chips)&#10;   eyebrow · title · lead · meta · standard_panel · spotlight · kicker · price · tags · actions · dots&#10;   Toolbar elements&#10;   search · sort · result_meta · filter_chips · clear&#10;   Also expanded&#10;   Card fields now include quick_view and case_study_link" />
    <MESSAGE value="#5 Admin Page realign and floating Save Button to access easily" />
    <MESSAGE value="#5 Hero element toggles now apply across all hero variants and visual style presets." />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Company logo name and subtitle resize in desktop and mobile" />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Logo tagline now accepts and renders limited HTML" />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 while selecting the background image, also need to customization to select shading style.&#10;   for the actual catalog image selection, also need to apply fit to available space as checkbox, and fix percentage for each catalog item. in /admin/Inventory - media" />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 The Media modal is now a compact studio layout with a live preview" />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Shadow and Fit are now independent for background vs each attached image, and public cards no longer use a gray wash." />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Marketplace catalog cards are wired end-to-end.&#10;   Admin → Catalog settings → Layout and listing fields&#10;   •&#10;   Card style: Marketplace (Amazon-like) or Overlay&#10;   •&#10;   Card body background: color picker + hex (saved per catalog type)&#10;   Public cards (Marketplace)&#10;   •&#10;   Image sits above; body sits below with your chosen background&#10;   •&#10;   Media is clean like the popup — no gray wash or product drop-shadow&#10;   •&#10;   Overlay mode keeps the previous cinematic text-over-media look&#10;   Default is Marketplace. Save catalog settings once so PreProd picks up the new columns via schema self-heal" />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Marketplace cards now use the same inventory presentation as the popup:&#10;   •&#10;   Background image + background shadow (soft / medium / strong / bottom / none)&#10;   •&#10;   Product image shadow when a background is set&#10;   •&#10;   Fit percent still applied as before&#10;   Cards no longer strip those classes or force box-shadow: none, so Inventory settings show on catalog-card-media the same way they do in the detail gallery." />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 In Admin → Catalog settings → Layout and listing fields, use Catalog card fields checkboxes:&#10;   •&#10;   Media: product image&#10;   •&#10;   Card body: category, title, price/stat, description, tags, availability, lead time, quick view, detail-page link&#10;   Unchecked fields are hidden on public cards. Save settings after changing toggles." />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Marketplace CSS was wiping background-image, so the inventory background never showed on cards.&#10;   Now:&#10;   •&#10;   Background + product image both render in catalog-card-media (same as popup), with shadow/fit settings&#10;   •&#10;   Admin Media row: Product image | Background image (compact, single-line, no-wrap)&#10;   •&#10;   Uncheck either to hide that layer; save catalog settings after changing" />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 Inventory per-item Fit % (default ~78%) — that still drives the popup only.&#10;   Where to control listing cards now: Admin → Catalog settings → Layout and listing fields&#10;   •&#10;   Card image fill (70–100%, default 94%) — how large the product image is inside catalog-card-media&#10;   •&#10;   Card media inset — None / Snug / Roomy — padding around the image (default Snug)&#10;   Raise fill toward 100% and use None or Snug to cut empty margin. Save settings after changing." />
    <MESSAGE value="#6 deploy error fixed" />
